      "message": "Patch Set 1:\n\n(1 comment)\n\nAI code review results below, please doublecheck\n\nMostly good, one minor comment inline. The canmount=noauto change matches OpenZFS 2.2+ behaviour: changelist_postfix() only auto-mounts when the refreshed canmount reads 'on', and an explicit 'zfs mount <dataset>' still mounts a noauto dataset, so the test also keeps working on older ZFS.",
